From: Paulo Gomes <paulo@entire.io>
Subject: [PATCH] plugin: record telemetry for the rsl plugin

Adds rsl (entireio/entire-rsl) to officialPlugins so `entire rsl`
invocations emit cli_plugin_executed like other Entire-shipped plugins.

Drafted against entireio/cli main at 21836151e. Not opened as a PR.

Signed-off-by: Paulo Gomes <paulo@entire.io>
---
diff --git a/cmd/entire/cli/plugin_official.go b/cmd/entire/cli/plugin_official.go
index f9e0e36..cd4ea55 100644
--- a/cmd/entire/cli/plugin_official.go
+++ b/cmd/entire/cli/plugin_official.go
@@ -11,7 +11,8 @@ import "slices"
 //nolint:gochecknoglobals // package-level allowlist; mutated by tests via snapshot/restore.
 var officialPlugins = []string{
 	// Add Entire-shipped plugin names here as they're released.
-	"ci", // entire-ci: customer-facing CI-integration management (entireio/entire-ci)
+	"ci",  // entire-ci: customer-facing CI-integration management (entireio/entire-ci)
+	"rsl", // entire-rsl: gittuf RSL inspection and verification (entireio/entire-rsl)
 }
 
 func IsOfficialPlugin(name string) bool {
